OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in bin bag has no
OL,4,ADNA database match
OL,5,
OL,6,FForensic tests on a woman found dead
OL,7,Finside a bin bag in a Liverpool park
OL,8,Fhave produced a DNA profile, but it has
OL,9,Fnot matched the UK's national database,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FThe woman, believed to have been about
OL,13,F70, was discovered in the walled garden
OL,14,Fnear the Isla Gladstone Conservatory in
OL,15,FStanley Park, Anfield on 28 August.
OL,17,FMerseyside Police said it had also been
OL,18,Funable to compare dental records as
OL,19,Fdetectives continued trying to identify
OL,20,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
